30 (a) "Firearm"shallhavethesamemeaningasprovidedinRSA173-B:1,XI.
31 (b) "Magazine disconnect mechanism" shall mean a mechanism that prevents a
32 semiautomaticfirearmfromfiringwhenthedetachablemagazineisnotfullyinsertedinthefirearm.
